TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, exchange

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH      7.0
    Na      1.0
    Cl      1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH      7.0
    Ca      1.0
    Cl      2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -activities Na+

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 10
END
